#!args --check
# gametest --check runs in the console: every test group of lib/game and its bridge against their references
# (world, tick, input, camera, bridge; the bridge offscreen on the GPU, SKIP without one) and of its netcode
# (netcodec, lagcomp, room, netsim on the simulated link, bots: 16 of them against the limits); exit code 1
# when a check fails.  The determinism checksums (--checksum, --netsum) are compared across the targets by hand
# (docs/GAMECORE.md and docs/NETCODE.md, "Prüfsumme").
